    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't want small steps though. i'm tired of just observing. it feels like i'm just waiting for a life that's never gonna start. like i'm just taking up space and making the world slightly more crowded for no reason. if i just stopped showing up, would it even change anything for anyone?",
